(6977349, 1052706, 54446, '<td valign="top">Well, this is a mighty fine b&amp;w landscape.  Tangentially, it DOES meet the challenge.  But, then I am very tolerant.  You make a good point with this photo, as I''ll guess you are getting slammed.  It''s the best photography in the challenge.  I''ll bump it up to a "10".  Sorry if this frustrates a perverse effort to achieve a brown ribbon with this quality image.  10</td>', 'Well, this is a mighty fine b&w landscape.  Tangentially, it DOES meet the challenge.  But, then I am very tolerant.  You make a good point with this photo, as I''ll guess you are getting slammed.  It''s the best photography in the challenge.  I''ll bump it up to a "10".  Sorry if this frustrates a perverse effort to achieve a brown ribbon with this quality image.  10', '2013-02-11 15:17:53.000000', NULL, 1),
