(6981502, 1052838, 49109, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Debbi:</b></div><hr/><i> Wow, great...shutter 1/4000 ? Lol more like flash duration 1/128 power </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Not at all, high-speed sync works differently, you lose only 2.5 stops (not 7)</td>', 'Originally posted by Debbi: Wow, great...shutter 1/4000 ? Lol more like flash duration 1/128 power  Not at all, high-speed sync works differently, you lose only 2.5 stops (not 7)', '2013-02-19 03:13:52.000000', NULL, 0),
